{"id":"2a5690af909fbb4d","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-single-variable-substitution.md","title":"单变量替换与目标替换","display":"df-single-variable-substitution — 单变量替换与目标替换","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-df-single-variable-substitution","aliases":["56-df-single-variable-substitution"],"display":"df-single-variable-substitution — 单变量替换与目标替换","depends_on":["[[56-df-unification-problem]]","[[56-df-substitution-application]]"],"source_section":"§2.1.3; §7.7 Table 7.9","source_printed_pages":"31–32,291","source_ocr_blocks":[52,53,312],"source_verification":"statement-compared; proof-scope-in-Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-single-variable-substitution"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-single-variable-substitution</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-single-variable-substitution — 单变量替换与目标替换"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8198395909603c44\" href=\"?note=8198395909603c44\" title=\"56-df-unification-problem\">56-df-unification-problem</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6aa7f56f36c897f4\" href=\"?note=6aa7f56f36c897f4\" title=\"56-df-substitution-application\">56-df-substitution-application</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§2.1.3; §7.7 Table 7.9"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"31–32,291"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>52</span><span>53</span><span>312</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"statement-compared; proof-scope-in-Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathcal V,t\\in T\">\\(x\\in\\mathcal V,t\\in T\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\in\\mathcal G\">\\(E\\in\\mathcal G\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in S\">\\(\\sigma\\in S\\)</span>，项和目标接口见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8198395909603c44\" href=\"?note=8198395909603c44\" title=\"56-df-unification-problem\">56-df-unification-problem</a>，后缀项替换见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6aa7f56f36c897f4\" href=\"?note=6aa7f56f36c897f4\" title=\"56-df-substitution-application\">56-df-substitution-application</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"[x:=t]\\coloneqq\\{(x,t)\\}\\cup\\{(y,y)\\mid y\\in\\mathcal V\\setminus\\{x\\}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[[x:=t]\\coloneqq\\{(x,t)\\}\\cup\\{(y,y)\\mid y\\in\\mathcal V\\setminus\\{x\\}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"E\\sigma\\coloneqq\\{(s\\sigma,t\\sigma)\\mid(s,t)\\in E\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[E\\sigma\\coloneqq\\{(s\\sigma,t\\sigma)\\mid(s,t)\\in E\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是算法规则中实际使用的一次性变量消去及其逐方程作用。替换是同时替换：即使x出现于t，图[x:=t]仍良定义；避免自出现的条件由算法规则另行要求。与λ演算的捕获规避替换无关。</p>\n<p>来源为用户提供的 Terese (2003) 本地 DjVu，本轮重新提取文字层后比对上述章节。OCR 页块以 U+001F 分段从1计数，不等同于 DjVu 物理扫描页；未取得 PDF 页码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-unification-problem","status":"resolved","id":"8198395909603c44","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-unification-problem]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-substitution-application","status":"resolved","id":"6aa7f56f36c897f4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-substitution-application]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-unification-problem","status":"resolved","id":"8198395909603c44","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$x\\in\\mathcal V,t\\in T$，$E\\in\\mathcal G$，$\\sigma\\in S$，项和目标接口见 [[56-df-unification-problem]]，后缀项替换见 [[56-df-substitution-application]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-substitution-application","status":"resolved","id":"6aa7f56f36c897f4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$x\\in\\mathcal V,t\\in T$，$E\\in\\mathcal G$，$\\sigma\\in S$，项和目标接口见 [[56-df-unification-problem]]，后缀项替换见 [[56-df-substitution-application]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"x\\in\\mathcal V,t\\in T","display":false},{"tex":"E\\in\\mathcal G","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma\\in S","display":false},{"tex":"[x:=t]\\coloneqq\\{(x,t)\\}\\cup\\{(y,y)\\mid y\\in\\mathcal V\\setminus\\{x\\}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"E\\sigma\\coloneqq\\{(s\\sigma,t\\sigma)\\mid(s,t)\\in E\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1431,"backlinks":[{"id":"6ab7b6083e677200","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal G,\\mathcal G_\\bot,T,S,\\bot$ 见 [[56-df-unification-problem]]；$\\operatorname{Var}$ 见 [[56-df-variables]]；$\\iota=\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathcal V}$ 见 [[56-df-substitution-composition]]，$[x:=t]$ 与目标替换见 [[56-df-single-variable-substitution]]。$E,F\\in\\mathcal G_\\bot$，$\\delta\\in S$；$G\\in\\mathcal G$，$x\\in\\mathcal V$，$f,g\\in\\mathcal F$，$k=\\operatorname{ar}(f)$，$m=\\operatorname{ar}(g)$，各 $s_i,t_i,t\\in T$。以下六族中的方程 $e\\in T^2$ 由该族给出的等式确定，且要求 $e\\notin G$。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-80","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-single-variable-substitution.md]]"}],"outgoing":["8198395909603c44","6aa7f56f36c897f4"]}